From: Daniel Paes <78096758+paesdan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 23:48:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Runink fork: credit upstream, say what changes

LICENSE keeps "The DEsk authors" and adds the fork's own copyright line;
NOTICE and the top of the README credit fyzugx and the DEsk authors, link
upstream, and list what the fork changes.

Signed-off-by: Daniel Paes <78096758+paesdan@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 LICENSE    |  1 +
 NOTICE     | 20 ++++++++++++++++++++
 README.md  |  3 +++
 SHA256SUMS |  5 +++--
 4 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 NOTICE

diff --git a/LICENSE b/LICENSE
index d878dc5..350a20b 100644
--- a/LICENSE
+++ b/LICENSE
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 MIT License
 
 Copyright (c) 2026 The DEsk authors
+Copyright (c) 2026 The RIVER Authors (changes in the Runink fork; see NOTICE)
 
 Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy
 of this software and associated documentation files (the "Software"), to deal
diff --git a/NOTICE b/NOTICE
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..bf7fb1a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/NOTICE
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+This is the Runink fork of DEsk.
+
+DEsk is by fyzugx and the DEsk authors: https://github.com/fyzugx/DEsk
+(MIT License, LICENSE). The fork follows upstream's releases and carries a
+short series of changes on top of them; each one that suits upstream is
+offered there.
+
+What the fork changes (`git log upstream/main..`):
+
+- The build runs no Python: tools/glsl2c.c and tools/room-key.c, built by
+  the build itself, replace scripts/glsl2c.py and scripts/room-key.py, and
+  tools/checkwords (Go) replaces scripts/check-words.py. The icon generator
+  scripts are not carried; the SVGs they drew are.
+- It runs on systems without systemd: sd-bus from libelogind, --systemd and
+  systemctl only where systemd is init, loginctl for powering off.
+- -Dweather_default=false builds a desk that asks the network nothing until
+  its user turns the weather on.
+
+Nothing upstream wrote has been relicensed; the fork's own changes are under
+the same MIT License, as "The RIVER Authors".
diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 5fc0916..4d8cfdd 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -2,6 +2,9 @@
 
 # DEsk
 
+> This is the **Runink fork** of DEsk, by fyzugx and the DEsk authors
+> ([upstream](https://github.com/fyzugx/DEsk)). What it changes is in [NOTICE](NOTICE).
+
 **v0.1.4 (BETA)** -- fixes (a session no longer ends when a monitor goes to sleep, and laptops whose firmware screen stays beside the graphics card get the desk on the right screen), GTK 4 programs on paper, and Arabic and more as a second keyboard layout. See [RELEASE-NOTES.md](RELEASE-NOTES.md).
 
 I've created a Discord server!
